The '''cold ocean''' is a cold variant of the [[ocean]] biome with slightly less underwater vegetation. It generates near cold biomes and has a [[Deep Cold Ocean|deep variant]].

== Generation ==
Cold oceans replace oceans in the cold temperature zones, often near [[taiga]]s and [[old growth taiga]]s. As a shallow ocean, they can border coastal biomes but never [[mushroom fields]]. Cold oceans border [[deep cold ocean]]s as well as [[ocean]]s and [[frozen ocean]]s.

== Description ==
[[File:Ocean colors.png|thumb|200px|The separate colors of each ocean variant {{in|java}}]]
The cold ocean uses a dark indigo water color at the surface. Like regular oceans, its floor is made up mainly of [[gravel]]. The vegetation in cold oceans has less [[seagrass]] compared to other ocean variants.

The same mobs as in regular oceans spawn here, namely [[salmon]], [[cod]], and [[dolphin]]s.{{only|be|short=1}} [[Ocean ruins]] use their cold variant and [[shipwreck]]s are common. Occasional islands in cold oceans are covered by [[grass block]]s with default vegetation.

With [[Vibrant Visuals]], cold oceans use default environmental settings with a coolish color grading, making the biome appear colder blue. They use cold sunlight, which is slightly brighter at dusk and dawn.

